{"generated": "2026-11-21 03:15", "brief": "<b>1. 앤트로픽 IPO 역풍 및 글로벌 AI주 투매</b>\nAI 스타트업 앤트로픽이 260억 달러 규모의 공모를 마치고 증시에 입성했으나, 상장 이틀째 급락세를 보이며 시장에 AI 거품론을 다시 불러일으켰습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFBCRFQ3R2lwLV8xeE40aFhGZFE0QTNqZTlBMzRyY0tWZy1BUHpGN3gtaFRhdXd6Y0gwanE2ODBMN0NtSHc3WkJ0dC1XOXlGOXNLdUl0RXFZVExXUk0?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#26</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxONWtHdEk1RE1wbFpTcHhtSDVuSnFRMHI2VWRJcDdiSU9hNXhPQUZXSnpocE12b0sxUmphX3R1SHpSMTZCM1pqQTlNOVZPQWN6S3UwUnFZNEFfZ1VjYmZxdWNheURrNEwycG9VdFZzSWlsODhSOFFIZGZoUjVCa3ZrU0RtTjNQTFpvLU95QWYweVlieXgySUtGVm45WngydnZxUGVKblJmd0NKZw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#36</a>]. 이로 인해 글로벌 기술주 매도세가 심화되었으며, 알파벳의 CDS 프리미엄이 사상 최고치를 기록하는 등 자본시장의 AI 투자 불안이 확산되고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1VTVdVbDdZak9EaENLVjFLQkNqdk9MbjFWS1FGQ3V3TUpIVFlEU2owVVp6bHcyTTNpMkd2RWJSTFVFd01HbVNhNWQ2Z2prdW1uNmh6WXNXYWdnckU?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#22</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNSWVuWk9xNWZDQ2NmcE5FYVlOYnE3TklRNVV4dlA2anhQcWVxTTNIV19aN3Y4WHc5RGthaXBqZlNkVklHSlpaOHlYSTU5X2ZYOHF1U0g4djdQUkRHeE8ybU03SUNlN01lVUw4eXMydlJCOW9PZFFDUzR0dC1Zd1lrQQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#31</a>].\n\n<b>2. SK하이닉스, 키옥시아 CB 주식 전환으로 지분 확보</b>\nSK하이닉스가 보유 중이던 일본 반도체 기업 키옥시아(구 도시바메모리)의 전환사채(CB)를 보통주로 전격 전환했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOLTU0ZElJbkVPMGJVWGdGQlVDYTNMbkYzR2oyd0tHUGpwbHVVdjFXMGVoUldnNFJ0M2dhYVFXVmRCUzZUQ3NiSkdLSGFmR3R4ZHZ4cTlWa0t6RTVWY0N3UDdPMXp1d2lRZlZqYXlIUVhPVXBKT2hJVGxYR0ZzMjdWRU52OWs1VzRa?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#11</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE5pQ21JSHVxSEFFV2pOcTVwUk1EZ3Vwb2gwS3NNWVhhRnBBQTNibkpjLWpyam5Nb0NPU2JlQ0t4emZERTd6WWNGMGFJMGw0cG5hYW9UblotRTl5MVZZbzBhbkdPMExiWUhDREE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a>]. 이번 전환을 통해 SK하이닉스는 키옥시아 지분 14.1%를 공식 확보하며 글로벌